OL,3,A'I have to be up for work soon...':
OL,4,AGamers stay up for GTA 6 after midnight
OL,5,Arelease
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrand Theft Auto 6 has been released
OL,8,Faround the world, ending the 13-year
OL,9,Fwait for a new instalment of the game
OL,11,FThe game is being released at midnight
OL,12,Facross different time zones - meaning
OL,13,Fthose in New Zealand were the first to
OL,14,Fplay
OL,16,FIn the UK, some gamers found it hard to
OL,17,Fgo to bed after the long-awaited
OL,18,Frelease
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
