OL,3,A'I have to be up for work soon...':
OL,4,AGamers stay up for GTA 6 after midnight
OL,5,Arelease
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I have to be up for work in five
OL,8,Fhours," one gamer told us overnight.
OL,9,F"Why am I playing a game I have years
OL,10,Fto enjoy?"
OL,12,FGTA 6, in which players explore a
OL,13,Ffictional US state called Leonida,
OL,14,Ffeatures the series' first playable
OL,15,Ffemale protagonist in a 3D setting
